{"job_id":"F-617bca20534c80a4b8e6","family_id":"F-617bca20534c80a4b8e6","title":"국방정보본부령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":7,"target_id":"e2dcc0663bc61d379925ffb9b9199ae9ef6991d5436d3ec2cde60fa81ab062f4","source_hash":"fc5ca6fd25027f08cda9278d3e80ae5a309f0eaeb9046c0a14429941a428cdc9","text":"国防情报总部命令"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":96,"target_id":"af32d62d049f6fae8761b87ea697f4ea6526ebf3a5eafd70cb6a23d3806e70e9","source_hash":"2d59a1fec857886d6c98bcaeef62cd89e031210b43eb93a4a8faf02a0f3f37b8","text":"第一条（设立）国防情报司令部设于国防部长之下，负责监督军事情报、军事安全以及军事情报能力建设等事宜。<2009年12月30日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":96,"end":539,"target_id":"b212a909f76d2eb82596a236df5bcbd580caca3006a9a9bb42db8271823bcca2","source_hash":"7412c77332f921a3f0e94b21fc1de9b394ccf39e5fb9739bacbaaa6397c5d4de","text":"第一条第二款（职责）国防情报局（以下简称“情报局”）应履行下列各款规定的职责。<2011年7月1日修订，2026年4月7日修订>\n1. 国防信息政策与规划的整合与协调\n2. 关于国际事务评估以及海外军事情报的收集、分析、制作和传播的行动\n3. 军事战略信息的收集、分析、制作和传播\n4. 军事外交和国防工业所需的信息支持任务\n5. 海外使团武官的派遣和运作\n6. 与驻韩外国武官的合作及与外国的信息交流\n7. 负责情报总部管辖下特种军事情报预算编制和运作的相关工作\n8. 与军事安全和国防工业安全政策相关的职责，包括网络安全\n9. 与建立军事情报能力相关的任务\n10. 与军事技术信息相关的职责\n11. 与军事相关的地理空间信息（包括图像信息；以下简称“信息”）和气象信息相关的职责\n12. 其他与军事情报相关的职责\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":539,"end":603,"target_id":"72507d9db3880a019bbac4902bb6a66eaf275ff65e0075b051355229f3c3b618","source_hash":"4843cd401173e3fa5d3ba3d154fc35539963c1e6b8d0e82dfacc30c34305044d","text":"第二条（总部主任的任命）设立情报总部主任一人，并指派一名将军。<2017年9月5日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":603,"end":870,"target_id":"d85f4bf4cfeeacb5c4168879a90f115451d6305954e8b8a88f89ad6e108c9285","source_hash":"1155812c1cda7977a6122f87589b83d89819d1e4a264745c10c44bc065cdefde","text":"第三条（部门主管等的职责）\n① 情报司令部司令奉国防部长之命，负责情报司令部的整体运作，并指挥和监督情报司令部下属或委派的各单位。<2011年7月1日修订>\n② 主任为参谋长联席会议履行军事指挥职责提供情报支持。<修订于2011年7月1日，2026年4月7日>\n③ 总部负责人因不可抗力无法履行职责时，由依据第四条第一款设立的情报总部各部门负责人中资历最深者代为履行职责。<2009年12月30日、2011年7月1日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":870,"end":1278,"target_id":"98457bac06185bb23a149d6a7dc2ed3f4641b240aee5154b5458b1bb4314c43b","source_hash":"2d65f87d87a27b2e70435855c9ad93cc4db795fe6cffc8d50da64f4287d0c899","text":"第四条（部门和单位的设立）\n① 情报总部内应设立必要的参谋部门，其组织和职责划分等事宜由国防部长决定。\n② 情报总部下设下列单位。<2009年12月30日、2011年7月1日、2018年12月4日、2026年4月7日修订>\n1. 设立情报司令部，负责监督与军事相关的地理空间信息、人力情报、技术情报、测量信息和符号信息等（以下简称“地理空间信息等”）的收集、支持和研究，以及作为防御措施的反情报行动，以防范敌人收集地理空间信息等。\n2. 777 指挥部负责监督与各种信号情报的收集、支持和研究相关的行动\n3. 删除<2018.12.4>\n③ 依据第2款各分项规定，各单位的组织和职责划分事宜，由国防部长决定。<2009年12月30日新增>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1278,"end":1324,"target_id":"bcee20587b6eb04fc1ca73fd9a16a617cbf63da58d3a7f3b23a494fda3dd6d09","source_hash":"2adcb3b8170cf24bbefcc72f68a8becd86bd2270c1c4f6353448ed71a8ff4b55","text":"第五条（人员配额） 军事人员和文职人员应分配到情报总部，人员配额由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1324,"end":1348,"target_id":"47052eca1c81eb2791641beecfb64bd567c5d374331bb5dc74158323efc939a2","source_hash":"e9e29cf30b50071adf1d368f2abb86951aca396410c613b7cdf67cf438a4fe7e","text":"补充规定 <1999年3月30日第16208号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1348,"end":1377,"target_id":"8a7497657055dcc8e7e4876e2a0db96d56947cd8292624733b863f77d93e044c","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1377,"end":1423,"target_id":"62a41c7bc752d226449dcd1c91aab652aba84415c8661e8f26657f85e396da7e","source_hash":"a9ccdb21b1a86a799e04c1d52786558eaf323f6ce1600f1fd3ad90926fb1ca92","text":"第二条（废止的法令） 兹废止武装部队情报司令部命令和国防部第777部队命令。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1423,"end":1826,"target_id":"796e723bd55372957ecaa253b504de4464ada241e3595c22a9756e98c6d3071a","source_hash":"01235435f40f27509c922ae0b831af913d89648c7f1a81186f46dd69ffb59134","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）① 根据《武装部队组织法》第九条第三款，修改各以作战为主要任务的武装部队的作战单位等条例如下。\n\n  删除第三条第一款。\n\n  ②《军事秘密保护法实施细则》修改如下。\n\n  在第 4 条第 1 款第 6 项中，“武装部队情报司令部司令”应改为“情报司令部司令”。\n\n  ③ 《军事人员法》实施细则修改如下。\n\n  第 13 条第 1 款第 2 项第 (a) 项中，“国防部特别情报部队司令兼武装部队情报司令部司令”应改为“情报司令部司令兼第 777 部队司令”。\n\n  在附件表 1 的陆军职位栏中，将“武装部队情报司令部司令”改为“情报司令部司令”，将“国防部特别情报部队司令”改为“第 777 部队司令”，并删除“国防情报局副局长”。\n\n  ④ 《行政权力委托管理条例》修改如下。\n\n  第 23 条第 3 款中的“武装部队情报司令部司令”应改为“国防情报局局长”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1826,"end":1851,"target_id":"bda2720683431b469f583a4f971a4f3d92eea37d5645743735dcda764676935c","source_hash":"c60504fc5b7311a0e0821e7ff420b4c7e2ac5a9a68488578cc95b214acacefa6","text":"补充规定 <第21915号，2009年12月30日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1851,"end":1880,"target_id":"2ae00bad41dd427b962e6ab3926322de5fa7b9ac62b5b6af3d4e23539ceecfcd","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1880,"end":2099,"target_id":"590f76e1d03635367f6988ea32745d0c9fcbd7c2238f2ef9015c2d221a16cabd","source_hash":"32ec2d5ba10a97c16a4c487a444f1048dab1e8439711e34edf5d900b456fccd3","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）①《国防改革法实施令》部分内容修改如下。\n\n  第十九条第一款第六项规定如下。\n\n    6. 第777部队指挥官\n\n  ②《军事人员法实施令》部分内容修改如下。\n\n  第十三条第一款第二项（甲）项中的“国防部特别情报部队司令”应改为“第777司令部司令”。\n\n  在附件表 1 的陆军职位栏中，“第 3275 部队指挥官”应改为“第 777 司令部指挥官”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2099,"end":2222,"target_id":"570532a288c6174ee504882590429ca3a41dcb08183e188b48a8288c64039fd5","source_hash":"7d1c40706597cfb7db5b91a0d37a3d333b3c181a7f1ce0761900d666aa11d9b6","text":"第三条（与其他法律法规的关系）在本法令实施时，其他法律法规提及原《国防情报总部条例》的规定，而本法令中也有相应规定的，则应视为以本法令的有关规定代替原规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2222,"end":2257,"target_id":"248637c507fd1adc5fc5301e9d99ca06ed149ab38a3a288588ca13680b672da9","source_hash":"f34337c06f638adcdfd580c516135801cae8ce7c6a5150d2f1db9e4106f04a96","text":"增编（参谋长联席会议组织结构）<第22672号，2011年2月22日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2257,"end":2286,"target_id":"5a202ed8faf78fbe1f84124baf0c33a281e3c00b1273f19797edb254d750f91f","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2286,"end":2373,"target_id":"978f94950ba400251b47673fc7e4b3fe8357a67c71c78e60a6665741fbc0a128","source_hash":"266c6fb4b90f2694eaa60927f886b7f8c66b1f83fd91f3a78013df26618709a3","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）①国防情报本部条例部分修改如下。\n\n  第三条第二款中的“发电司令部”应改为“军事支援司令部”。\n\n  ② 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2373,"end":2381,"target_id":"547e86e060c87b89dfd3f2c7d24dbe9349754e5aa7acf7308146665d337e5413","source_hash":"fab18bd1e0d74a271eea817ca2d5dff62d53ec4d5214a8c48af3c4adbab54a93","text":"第3条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2381,"end":2404,"target_id":"004aa0aeb2c6efcb55692c25a8586226cb17d5e896a72ce573d3def8b2a7a6e8","source_hash":"2f801faba6fc9238b834fe4c96560466df605745048d1ded8a4cac4e39944137","text":"补充规定 <第23007号，2011年7月1日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2404,"end":2433,"target_id":"19f86601b4c1e6f463643660b28734b6e1c2bb28e11c3a87fb6d924035b3f0ec","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2433,"end":2523,"target_id":"e9714fb97c12d6bc808cb4e464a629f989d5077e56cf546dd54c09f37285dc66","source_hash":"38f03745f0796b0550769766088a32066cafc4699e55d6c56d672ccb5eecbc9b","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）《国防改革法实施令》部分内容修改如下。\n\n  第十九条第一款第六项规定如下。\n\n    6. 777 Commander\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2523,"end":2556,"target_id":"e105bf49b241a8d71cf30e3ab07abe775e82e8a7a2cdcc055b4a3467df2fc8a9","source_hash":"46ae83072f863724fe582dfad77d64d08ffc2625dcab5f104235e03aafc9074d","text":"补充规定（《军事人员法》实施令）<第28266号，2017年9月5日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2556,"end":2593,"target_id":"44472351195dc2cbccb5a61cd4f4ebce10e2b3b6cc4b3493295ec6a4597e4235","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2593,"end":2607,"target_id":"947ca925a47437774068547dbb0b330e8dbebcf0ed26de56623f501431f4554b","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"条款 2 和 3 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2607,"end":2670,"target_id":"b6ab8cc2441e5c7dc265ef69a4660439decf2fd50a021b9361e707e03117c126","source_hash":"987943b51bf3742596018964fba2a0d8a812f6daca6e4215dd19a84f7d30cbb1","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至<30> 已省略\n\n  <31> 国防情报总部命令的部分内容修订如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2670,"end":2723,"target_id":"f2bbd403a53a8550b2e73cef7e08891f4649af58a2c4a486a6a14b9b63d91760","source_hash":"5ac1b1947a330162629dda3c7af337078e7d5618a1dacdb0720128de68e89e98","text":"  第 2 条中的“部长级”应改为“将军级”。\n\n  <32> 至 <90> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00028","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2723,"end":2767,"target_id":"62664bf7484fde83c9481dbc9516f26a7be47ff4fde73fe46a305538dad0e5a1","source_hash":"fc95b832da40a903f39c3c443feedf36e2ca18a635b00b2d8b1c4f04932ba535","text":"补充规定 <第29322号，2018年12月4日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00029","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-002873-285413-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2767,"end":2808,"target_id":"d0c500ecf2c809672912853a7321ddd0fd946a7927ea86765341f1280744bdc4","source_hash":"a1212168698fce4c46d7af7e7de55a4aec85a8628e5a3937f8b0d7d24b55a493","text":"补充规定 <第36242号，2026年4月7日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。"}]}